{
  "name": "Snitcher — Reviewed Workflows + Ask",
  "description": "Grouped allowlist for Rex Server, Claude Code, Codex and Orca: GitHub, packages, model and account services, search, documentation, academic sources, plus via rules for ad-hoc signed Homebrew tools (gh, curl, node) in the Rex and Orca terminals. Rex and Orca ts.net access; Rex Server high-port UDP for built-in Tailscale. Unmatched destinations ASK; add the Default Deny group to turn this into an allowlist.",
